  "solution": "Logic : (1st number ÷ 3rd number)² = 2nd number \n\nGiven :\n\n \n• (63, 81, 7)\n\n​(63 div 7)² = 81\n\n(9)² = 81\n\n81 = 81 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (84, 49, 12)​\n\n​(84 div 12)² = 49\n\n(7)² = 49\n\n49 = 49 (LHS = RHS)\n\n​So,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (99, 121, 9)​\n\n​(99 div 9)² = 121\n\n(11)² = 121\n\n**121 = 121 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (76, 234, 12)​\n\n​(76 div 12)² = 234\n\n(6.33)² = 234\n\n**40 ≠ 234 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (12, 125, 56)​\n\n​(12 div 56)² = 125\n\n(0.21)² = 125\n\n0.0441 ≠ 125 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (78, 14, 56)​\n\n​(78 div 56)² = 14\n\n(1.39)² = 14\n\n1.93 ≠ 14 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.\n\nf3:T1459,\n\n<",
